\fi0 On this issue of we are trying to improve the quality as well as the performance.\par
When I mean performance, I really mean it, we are trying to give a new direction to Duardrusti by organizing a printing version & reach out to Orissa village with a nominal price or so. Our sole purpose is to reach out & encourage next generation young writers to exploit their thoughts for a change in an improvised way, so that it can reach each individual who have a feelings to do something for Orissa. Today the voices of the brainstorming sessions of Odia-sAmja / Myodisa has reached out to inside & outside of Orissa including Govt. India / Govt. of Orissa / AG etc. But Odia-sAmja / Myodisa is not going to stay idle until such echo reached out each corner of Orissa & its people. The children of Orissa need to be awake & arise from the dust of fallen behind syndrome. And this is a mandatory requirement in order to survive & keep your identity intact in today\rquote s world. And duradrusti, Odia-sAmja ra mukhapatra, is a small step towards it. \par
\par
\fi720 At the end once again I don\rquote t hesitate to re iterate that I'm proud to be part of such great endeavor & requesting others to be part of such great endeavor through your contribution such as suggestions, comments, writings, even criticizing. Each & every drops of water is valuable enough to fill a glass.\par
\par
Best wishes!\par
\par
Biswaranjan Jena\par
CE, Odia Samaja\par
